<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Task>
    <Title>Uninstall WinZip 18.0 - 32 bit</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[
    Standard Uninstallation Fixlet Template.  See the Uninstall Wizard for details related to this fixlet.
    <P><B>Source Wizard:</B> <A href="http://bigfix.me/uninstall">http://bigfix.me/uninstall</A></P>
    <P>This fixlet is constructed from the following variables provided by the developer:</P>
    <P><B>Registry Source:</B> HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall</P>
    <P><B>Display Name:</B> WinZip 18.0</P>
    <P><B>Application Guid:</B> CD95F661-A5C4-44F5-A6AA-ECDD91C240E1</P>
    <P><B>Uninstall Command String:</B> MsiExec.exe /X{CD95F661-A5C4-44F5-A6AA-ECDD91C240E1} /quiet /norestart</P>
]]></Description>
    <Relevance>name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot;</Relevance>
    <Relevance>if exists property &quot;in proxy agent context&quot; then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists key whose (value &quot;DisplayName&quot; of it as string contains &quot;Winzip 18.0&quot; AND value &quot;UninstallString&quot; of it as string as lowercase contains &quot;msiexec&quot;) of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&quot; of registry</Relevance>
    <Category>Uninstall</Category>
    <Source>islacker</Source>
    <SourceID>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceID>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2015-03-16</SourceReleaseDate>
    <SourceSeverity>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceSeverity>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Mon, 16 Mar 2015 14:53:450</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to uninstall this software.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">
//User Defined Uninstall String
waithidden msiexec.exe /x{CD95F661-A5C4-44F5-A6AA-ECDD91C240E1} /quiet /norestart
</ActionScript>
      <SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
    </DefaultAction>
    <Action ID="Action956">
